OL,3, V -,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, The IRA has claimed responsibility for
OL,6,Gthe blast at a Royal Marines barracks
OL,7, at Deal, Kent, today.
OL,8,F
OL,9,FOf the 10 people who were killed in the
OL,10,Fblast, nine were Royal Marine band
OL,11,Fmembers.
OL,12,F
OL,13,FDefence Secretary Mr Tom King visited
OL,14,Fthe wrecked building today and accused
OL,15,FIRA "godfathers" of an "appalling
OL,16,Foutrage against young army bandsmen".
OL,17,F
OL,18,FThe explosion occurred near a crowded
OL,19,Fstaff room as the musicians took a
OL,20,Fcoffee break before beginning the first
OL,21,Fpractice session of the day.
OL,22,F
